Z||000000||DecadenceR||08-01-2001||01:42 AM||||WEll, it was about 10:30pm. I was driving home from the parkway exit. I have to pass the high school, and a few other little things. Like the resivour (i know I can't spell, sue me). I like to drive fast. I can be honest about that. Well, I was drving, and I saw a deer jet out. Thankfully I was paying attention, and I swerved. BARELY, I missed the deer. I also barely kept control of my car. I can honestly say that if I would have been able to swerve like that in my old Z28, I definitely would have lost the rear end and nailed a pole. Thank god for small cars!!!!||||reg||1
